+CONSTRAINTS: touch only the listed file; no new dependencies; the route must not be edited to use it.
+
+ACCEPTANCE (run from the project root; must print `T3 OK` and exit 0):
+`cd {work} && npx --no-install tsc --noEmit --incremental && node -e "const fs=require('fs');const p='lib/validate.ts';if(!fs.existsSync(p))process.exit(1);const s=fs.readFileSync(p,'utf8');if(!/export function validateTitle/.test(s))process.exit(1);if(!/export function isValidTitle/.test(s))process.exit(1);console.log('T3 OK')"`
